TestSuite 'Checks the department payment'

TestCase 'checks the number of department employees'
PERFORM AVERAGE-SALARY
EXPECT DEPT-NBR-EMPS TO BE 19

TestCase 'checks the total department salaries'
PERFORM AVERAGE-SALARY
EXPECT DEPT-TOTAL-SALARIES >= 111000

TestCase 'checks the average salary is greater than 5800'
PERFORM AVERAGE-SALARY
EXPECT DEPT-AVG-SALARY >= 5800

TestCase 'checks the average salary is less than 5900'
PERFORM AVERAGE-SALARY
EXPECT DEPT-AVG-SALARY <= 5900
